{"id":"bbe854d81e43f822","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-turing-degree.md","title":"Turing Degrees and Their Order","display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degrees and Their Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-turing-degree","aliases":["62-df-turing-degree"],"display":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degrees and Their Order","depends_on":["[[62-df-oracle-computation]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remarks I.3.4, I.7.5; §VIII.1","source_pages":[8,25,311],"source_pdf_pages":[26,43,329]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-turing-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-turing-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-turing-degree — Turing Degrees and Their Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Remarks I.3.4, I.7.5; §VIII.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>8</span><span>25</span><span>311</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>26</span><span>43</span><span>329</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在标准元理论中解释；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"06104e9b3d35ed9d\" href=\"?note=06104e9b3d35ed9d\" title=\"62-df-oracle-computation\">62-df-oracle-computation</a>。以下度是元层的子集族，不作为二阶算术中的集合变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\;A\\equiv_T B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\coloneqq[A]_T\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\;A\\equiv_T B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\coloneqq[A]_T\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\preceq_T\\operatorname{deg}_T(B)\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\preceq_T\\operatorname{deg}_T(B)\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>归约复合证明传递性，同一程序给出自反性；于是第二式与代表元无关并在等价类上反对称。度结构只用于元层解释；对象理论中的模型闭包使用数集之间的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span>，无需第三阶“所有度”的域。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Remarks I.3.4, I.7.5; §VIII.1；纸面页 8, 25, 311；PDF 页 26, 43, 329。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-oracle-computation]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"06104e9b3d35ed9d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N$ 在标准元理论中解释；$\\le_T$ 见 [[62-df-oracle-computation]]。以下度是元层的子集族，不作为二阶算术中的集合变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}turing\\text{-}degree}\\vdash\\;A\\equiv_T B\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B\\land B\\le_T A,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\coloneqq[A]_T\\coloneqq\\{B\\subseteq\\mathbb N:B\\equiv_T A\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{deg}_T(A)\\preceq_T\\operatorname{deg}_T(B)\\leftrightarrow A\\le_T B.","display":true},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false}],"bytes":1355,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-47","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-degree|Turing Degrees and Their Order]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-293","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-turing-degree]]"}],"outgoing":["06104e9b3d35ed9d"]}